{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29774","headline":"永乐县所居一草一木无非自栽今春悉已芳茂因书即事一章 · 李商隐","name":"永乐县所居一草一木无非自栽今春悉已芳茂因书即事一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手种悲陈事，心期玩物华。\n柳飞彭泽雪，桃散武陵霞。\n枳嫩栖鸾叶，桐香待凤花。\n绶藤萦弱蔓，袍草展新芽。\n学植功虽倍，成蹊迹尚赊。\n芳年谁共玩，终老邵平瓜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}